<title>ISRAEL: Blue Square Prop 4Q net 24.6 mln shekels.</title>
<headline>Blue Square Prop 4Q net 24.6 mln shekels.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's Blue Square Chain Stores Properties and Investments, a subsidiary of Blue Square Israel.</p>
<p>				   (in millions of shekels)</p>
<p>			  Q4 96	Q4 95	12-MTH 96  12-MTH 95</p>
